      "description": "Right-side native menu for tracks, episodes, skip markers and timer.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-tv-panel\"><h2>睡眠定时</h2><button>关闭</button><button>关闭定时</button><button>30 分钟后暂停</button><button>60 分钟后暂停</button></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-tv-panel{width:360px;padding:26px;background:#202027;color:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px}.ds-tv-panel h2{font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:400;margin:0}.ds-tv-panel button{padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(73,69,79,.8);color:rgba(230,225,229,.8);font:500 14px/20px sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1px}.ds-tv-panel button:hover,.ds-tv-panel button:focus-visible{background:#E6E1E5;color:#313033;transform:scale(1.1);outline:0}.ds-tv-panel button:active{transform:scale(1)}"
